    "name": "SQL Server Service Registration",
    "responsibility": "Stands ArgentSea up in a host for SQL Server: binds the configuration sections to the SQL Server settings objects and registers, as injectable singletons, the collection of configured databases and the collection of configured shard sets — each already wired to the SqlClient provider services. These are the objects an application injects, and this is the single call that produces them.",
